sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Web/Mobile Client
    participant GW as Edge Gateway
    participant Auth as JWT Auth & RBAC
    participant Zod as Zod Schema Validator
    participant Idem as Idempotency Gate
    participant Svc as Domain Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Kernel RLS)

    Client->>GW: HTTP Request + Bearer JWT + X-Request-ID
    GW->>Auth: Verify RS256 Signature & Extract auth.uid()
    alt Invalid/Expired Token
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID)
    end
    Auth->>Zod: Validate Request Headers & Body
    alt Schema Validation Fails
        Zod-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity (Field Errors)
    end
    Zod->>Idem: Check Idempotency-Key
    alt In-Flight / Cached Duplicate
        Idem-->>Client: Cached Response / 409 Conflict
    end
    Idem->>Svc: Execute Domain Logic (Injected auth.uid)
    Svc->>DB: Relational Transaction (WHERE user_id = auth.uid)
    DB-->>Svc: Query/Mutation Result
    Svc-->>GW: Domain Result Object
    GW-->>Client: HTTP 200/201/202 JSON Envelope
